abstract: >-
  Replication package (code, configs, protocols, and documentation) for evaluating
  line-level attributions of a decoder-only just-in-time defect-risk classifier on
  public JIT-Defects4J / JIT-Fine resources. Empirical results are versioned
  separately when frozen; this citation entry does not invent a paper DOI.
